#: tooltips.py:701
msgid "Example: apply the action to the selected Frame By Plane layers, then use Undo if the stack result is not what you expected."
msgstr "示例：将操作应用到选中的 Frame By Plane 层，然后如果堆栈结果不符合预期，请使用撤销。"

#: tooltips.py:702
msgid "Example: attach a mask to the whole layer or to one effect when you want the effect to appear only inside a drawn or generated matte."
msgstr "示例：当希望效果仅出现在绘制或生成的遮罩内时，将蒙版附加到整个层或某个效果。"

#: tooltips.py:706
msgid "Example: copy the report text and paste it into a bug report when a layer, effect or mask contract looks broken."
msgstr "示例：当层、效果或蒙版约定看起来有问题时，复制报告文本并粘贴到缺陷报告中。"

#: tooltips.py:707
msgid "Example: edit the cage points for perspective-style deformation, or use Camera Flatten to preserve the current camera appearance."
msgstr "示例：编辑笼形点以进行透视式变形，或使用摄像机展平以保留当前摄像机外观。"

#: tooltips.py:700
msgid "Example: import a PNG, image sequence, PSD/PSB or folder without changing the original source files. Procreate decoding is optional Preview functionality."
msgstr "示例：导入 PNG、图像序列、PSD/PSB 或文件夹，而不更改原始源文件。Procreate 解码是可选的预览功能。"

#: tooltips.py:708
msgid "Example: rebuild timing after inserting, reversing or splitting frames while keeping linked images on disk."
msgstr "示例：在插入、反转或拆分帧后重建时序，同时将链接的图像保留在磁盘上。"

#: tooltips.py:705
msgid "Example: run the utility before a final export to check that viewport-only helpers, masks and render state restore correctly."
msgstr "示例：在最终导出前运行该实用工具，以检查仅视图辅助对象、蒙版和渲染状态能否正确恢复。"

#: tooltips.py:703
msgid "Example: select the generated Grease Pencil canvas, draw the matte or strokes, then refresh the Frame By Plane mask if needed."
msgstr "示例：选择生成的蜡笔画布，绘制遮罩或笔触，然后根据需要刷新 Frame By Plane 蒙版。"

#: tooltips.py:704
msgid "Example: stack Motion items for procedural offset, rotation, scale or stagger, then bake them only when you need real keyframes."
msgstr "示例：堆叠运动项以进行程序化偏移、旋转、缩放或交错，然后仅在需要真实关键帧时烘焙它们。"

#: tooltips.py:709
msgid "Example: use this from the Layer List to select, duplicate, isolate, lock or reorder generated Frame By Plane rigs safely."
msgstr "示例：从层列表中使用此功能，以安全地选择、复制、隔离、锁定或重新排序生成的 Frame By Plane 绑定。"

